    {
      "text": "Their ribbonlike feelers increase their psychic power. They are always staring at something.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "They intently observe both Trainers and Pokémon. Apparently, they are looking at something that only Gothita can see.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Though they’re still only babies, there’s psychic power stored in their ribbonlike feelers, and sometimes they use that power to fight.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Even when nobody seems to be around, Gothita can still be heard making a muted cry. Many believe it’s speaking to something only it can see.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
